# Data Collection

In this notebook, we loaded the airport datasets and the flight delay dataset.

The raw datasets were stored inside data/raw.

Later, the data will be cleaned and filtered to include 5 selected countries.

import pandas as pd

airports = pd.read_csv("data/raw/airports.csv")
countries = pd.read_csv("data/raw/countries.csv")
regions = pd.read_csv("data/raw/regions.csv")
delays = pd.read_csv("data/raw/flight_delays.csv")

print(airports.head())
print(delays.head())

print(airports.info())
print(delays.info())

selected_countries = ['FR', 'DE', 'IT', 'ES', 'NL']

filtered_airports = airports[
    airports['iso_country'].isin(selected_countries)
]

filtered_airports.to_csv(
    "data/processed/filtered_airports.csv",
    index=False
)

print(filtered_airports['iso_country'].value_counts())
